{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "cf76d001-e5dd-87f2-be7e-45b02fb0a6a2",
  "created_at": "2026-03-06T11:01:13-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Judith Hazard",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Rosa Delgado",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:58:26-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Rosa Delgado."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:58:29-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Miss Delgado. My name is Judith Hazard. I have recently acquired a puppy, and I am told I must obtain a license for her. Kindly tell me how that is done."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:58:41-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, congratulations. Yes, dogs need to be licensed. You can do it here at the clerk's office. Are you in Newport?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:58:49-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I am. I am at 7 Brewer Street, in the Fifth Ward. Forgive me, I am walking at the moment, so if I sound breathless, it is because I am carrying my son's lunchbox to his school. He left it on the counter, and I am not at all certain I have the correct door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, no problem, take your time. So for the license, you come in person and fill out the form."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "In person. I see. And what would the fee be, if you would be so kind?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:21-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It depends on a couple of things, like whether she's spayed. I don't want to give you the wrong number, so when you come in we'll tell you exactly. Or I can have somebody check and call you back."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:35-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Spayed. Now, I do not know that. She is eleven weeks old. Would that matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:41-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "At eleven weeks, probably she isn't yet. That's fine, just tell us when you come. It does help to bring the vet paperwork."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:50-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The vet paperwork. Would that be the rabies certificate? I have a sheet from the veterinarian, but I confess I cannot tell what it is."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T10:59:59-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's probably it. Usually it says rabies vaccination on it. For a puppy that young, though, she may not have had it yet. If not, bring whatever the vet gave you and we'll see what's needed."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:12-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh dear. I understood the vaccination was already done. Perhaps it was only the first examination. Kindly say again what I should bring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:21-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Bring the vet papers, a photo ID, and something showing your address. And if you know whether she's spayed, bring that too."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:30-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Photo identification, proof of address, and the veterinary papers. Is a utility bill suitable for the address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A utility bill works, yes."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Wonderful. And am I to bring the dog herself, or only the papers?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:45-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the papers is fine. You don't need to bring her."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thank you. I believe I see the school now. Is there anything I have mixed up?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:00:56-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not really. Papers, ID, bill, come to City Hall. If the vaccine's not done yet, check with your vet first."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I shall telephone the veterinarian this afternoon, then. Thank you ever so much, Miss Delgado. Good day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-06T11:01:11-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye-bye."
    }
  ],
